{title: What a Beautiful Name (FJ_154_en)}
{song_number: 154}
{language: en}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]You were the Word at the beginning,
[G]one with God the [Bm]Lord Most [A]High.
[Bm]Your hidden glory [A]in creation,
[D]now re[G]vealed in [Bm]You, our [A]Christ.

{comment: Chorus 1}
What a [D]beautiful Name it is, what a [A]beautiful Name it is,
the [Bm]Name of Jesus [A]Christ, my [G]King.
What a [D]beautiful Name it is, [A]nothing compares to this.
What a [Bm]beautiful [A]Name it is, the [G]Name of Je[A]sus.

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]You didn't want heaven without us,
[G]so Jesus, You [Bm]brought heaven [A]down.
[Bm]My sin was great, Your [A]love was greater;
[D]what could [G]separate [Bm]us [A]now?

{comment: Chorus 2}
What a [D]wonderful Name it is, what a [A]wonderful Name it is,
the [Bm]Name of Jesus [A]Christ, my [G]King.
What a [D]wonderful Name it is, [A]nothing compares to this.
What a [Bm]wonderful [A]Name it is, the [G]Name of Je[A]sus.
What a [G]wonderful [Bm]Name it [A]is, the [G]Name of Jesus.

{comment: Bridge}
[G]Death could not hold You, the veil tore be[A]fore You;
You [Bm7]silence the boast of sin and [A]grave.
The [D]heavens are roaring the [G]praise of Your glory,
for [A]You are raised to [Bm7]life again.
You have [G]no rival, You have no e[A]qual;
[Bm7]now and forever God, You [A]reign.
[D]Yours is the kingdom, [G]Yours is the glory;
[A]Yours is the Name a[Bm7]bove all names.

{comment: Chorus 3}
What a [D]powerful Name it is, what a [A]powerful Name it is,
the [Bm]Name of Jesus [A]Christ, my [G]King.
What a [D]powerful Name it is, [A]nothing can stand against.
What a [Bm]powerful [A]Name it is, the [G]Name of Je[A]sus.
